From: Recipe integration <integration@example.org>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 19:12:27 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 3/7] fix(attention): intersect worker KV cache layouts

Pipeline-parallel ranks can expose different layout sets when their layers use different attention backends. Resolve the ordered intersection so hybrid models select a layout shared by every worker, while preserving a clear error for disjoint sets.

AI assistance was used for repository scouting and implementation; the human submitter reviewed the complete diff and validation.

Signed-off-by: Attribution retained by commit/source references; private contact removed
---
 tests/v1/attention/test_backend_per_kind.py | 29 ++++++++++++++++++++-
 vllm/v1/attention/backends/utils.py         | 21 ++++++++++-----
 2 files changed, 42 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

